## INPUT REQUIREMENTS

**Required Information:**

-   **Primary Keyword**: [Insert target keyword]

**Optional Information (Will be auto-populated with intelligent optimization if not provided):**

-   **Secondary Keywords**: [Insert 2-3 related keywords, comma-separated] - _If not provided, AI will intelligently generate 8-10 based on primary keyword and content optimization_
-   **Niche/Category**: [Use comma-separated categories from broad to specific - e.g., "animals, birds", "technology, mobile, android", or "plants" for single category] - _If not provided, AI will determine from primary keyword context_
-   **Tone**: [Multi-adjective format combining 2-3 descriptors - e.g., "Informative, engaging, and nature-inspired", "Professional, practical, and insight-driven", "Helpful, friendly, and gardening-focused"] - _If not provided, AI will suggest optimal tone combination based on keyword analysis. App will check database for user's previous tone preferences with similar keywords and auto-populate if pattern found_
-   **Point of View**: [First person, second person, third person, etc.] - _If not provided, AI will suggest optimal POV based on content type and regional preferences. App will check database for user's previous POV choices with similar content types and auto-populate if pattern found_
-   **Target Country** (Optional) [Specify: "United States" or "Global/International" - AI will regionalize research and terminology accordingly]
-   **Content Type** (Optional) [Select: "Article (Blog Post)", "Listicle", "Guide", "Review" - AI will optimize structure and approach accordingly]

**Article Sections/Outline** [List your desired headings/section structure] - _If not provided, AI will create optimized outline. When provided, AI will follow outline exactly with zero deviations (Strict Outline Mode)_

**Internal Links** (Optional) [If you have specific internal URLs for linking, provide them here as: "Internal URLs: url1, url2, url3..." OR "Enable Sitemap: domain.com" - Otherwise, AI will work with external links only]

**Additional Instructions** (Optional) [Provide any specific customizations, formatting requirements, or content handling preferences for this particular article. Examples: "Move scientific names to the article body where the animal was first mentioned", "Include price ranges in table format", "Add seasonal timing information for each technique", "Use bullet points for tool lists", "Include difficulty levels for each method", etc.]

