-   [ ] **NO SECTION ADDITIONS OR MODIFICATIONS** - Use ONLY the provided outline sections, no additional sections permitted
-   [ ] **CONTENT-WITHIN-STRUCTURE OPTIMIZATION** - Maximize content benefits without changing outline structure. Internal formatting (subheadings, tables, bullet lists, numbered lists, callouts, etc.) within existing major sections is encouraged and required for format diversity.

**CONTENT TYPE OPTIMIZATION (When Specified):**

